          "summary": "<p>财新网08月21日电：沪指开盘报3891.18点，跌幅0.32%。</p><p>深成指报13935.64点，跌幅0.27%；创业板指报3495.11点，跌幅0.01%；中小板指报8509.68点，跌幅0.44%。</p><p>盘面上，石油石化领涨，有色金属、非银金融、商贸零售、通信、美容护理等板块涨幅居前，医药生物领跌，农林牧渔、建筑材料、传媒、房地产、计算机等走弱。</p><p>消息面上，上海出台“沪八条”，首套房商贷首付最低15%；恒大系列案一审宣判，许家印被判无期徒刑；商务部回应美征收无人机关税，敦促美方立即撤销232相关关税措施；王兴兴称机器人工厂工作暂时不能大规模推广；泡泡玛特上半年海外营收下滑，CEO称今年重心在于调整而非冲业绩；美国30年期国债回吐美国财政部回购公告发布以来的涨幅。</p><p>撰写：财小智   责编：财小新</p><div class=\"yqzszb\" id=\"yqzszb\"><div class=\"header\"><div class=\"yqzszb-title\"><strong><span>上市公司敏感舆情指数</span></strong><img alt=\"数据+\" class=\"support\" src=\"https://entities.caixin.com/support.png\" /></div><p><em class=\"update-time\">更新时间：2026-08-21</em></p></div><div class=\"yqzszb-list\"><div class=\"list-header\"><div class=\"order\">排名</div><div class=\"others\"><div class=\"stock\">股票</div><div class=\"index\">今日指数</div><div class=\"comp\">较昨日</div></div></div><ul class=\"yqzszb-lists\"><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101002070\"><div class=\"row-order\">1</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101002070\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">宁沪高速<p><span class=\"stock-no\">600377.SH</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">26.07</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+26.07</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">江苏宁沪高速公路(00177.HK)拟现金收购苏锡常南部高速公司100%股权</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001134\"><div class=\"row-order\">2</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001134\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">力生制药<p><span class=\"stock-no\">002393.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">19.08</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+19.08</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">天津发展(00882)：力生制药中期归母净利润7832.6万元同比减少77.16%</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101000082\"><div class=\"row-order\">3</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101000082\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">莱宝高科<p><span class=\"stock-no\">002106.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">11.75</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+11.75</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">莱宝高科：关于2026年度向特定对象发行A股股票的审核问询函的回复及募集说明书等申请文件更新的提示性公告</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101003221\"><div class=\"row-order\">4</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101003221\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">完美世界<p><span class=\"stock-no\">002624.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">8.45</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+2.21</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">《异环》流水超20亿元，完美世界上半年业绩由盈转亏，新旧产品交替遭遇周期大考</div></a></div></li><li><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001133\"><div class=\"row-order\">5</div></a><div class=\"row-content\"><a href=\"https://stock.caixin.com/m/stock/details/101001133\"><div class=\"row-table\"><div class=\"row-info\"><div class=\"name cell\">联发股份<p><span class=\"stock-no\">002394.SZ</span></p></div><div class=\"price cell\">8.45</div><div class=\"rate cell\"><span class=\"price-up\">+8.45</span></div></div></div><div class=\"yqzszb-info\">联发股份副总经理刘桂根离任，年龄64岁</div></a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"yqzszb-infomation\"><ul><li>今日敏感舆情指数，面向所有A股上市公司，以其前一日9:00至当日9:00的敏感新闻和公告信息为基础，建立模型计算出的0-100的指数，用来表征该上市公司舆情敏感程度的高低。</li><li>本文列举了今日指数最高的5只股票，同时列举了今日指数较昨日的涨跌值，以及时间段内主要的敏感新闻之一。</li><li>获取更多上市公司信息和其他高级服务，请查阅<span><a href=\"http://database.caixin.com\">财新数据通</a></span>。</li><li>本报告基于大数据技术自动计算和生成，不代表财新数据观点。</li></ul></div></div>",
